==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - height: "100"
  - src: hyperbricks-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
==== explainer ====
The height of the images (can be a number or percentage)
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
